{"id":"97bed6d7bf721b62","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-model-end-extension.md","title":"ZFC Model End Extension","display":"df-zfc-model-end-extension — ZFC Model End Extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model-end-extension","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model-end-extension","58-df-zfc-model9-end-extension"],"display":"df-zfc-model-end-extension — ZFC Model End Extension","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch09/58-df-model.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model-end-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model-end-extension</span><span>58-df-zfc-model9-end-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model-end-extension — ZFC Model End Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"923884eb8fe4e61d\" href=\"?note=923884eb8fe4e61d\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-model.md\">../batch09/58-df-model.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\">\\(M,N\\)</span> (set-coded <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structures with universes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(M),\\mathrm{Univ}(N)\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(M),\\mathrm{Univ}(N)\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,L\">\\(T,L\\)</span> (background theory and language)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Model}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Model}_S\\)</span> (three-argument model predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"923884eb8fe4e61d\" href=\"?note=923884eb8fe4e61d\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-model.md\">../batch09/58-df-model.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot\\in\\in L.\\mathrm{Rel}_2\">\\(\\dot\\in\\in L.\\mathrm{Rel}_2\\)</span> (membership relation symbol, interpreted by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I^M_{\\mathrm{rel},2}\">\\(I^M_{\\mathrm{rel},2}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I^N_{\\mathrm{rel},2}\">\\(I^N_{\\mathrm{rel},2}\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModelEndExtension}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModelEndExtension}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>不传第五参数的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModelEndExtension}_S(M,N,T,L)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModelEndExtension}_S(M,N,T,L)\\)</span> 使用固定成员符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot\\in\">\\(\\dot\\in\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}end\\text{-}extension} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModelEndExtension}_S(M,N,T,L,\\dot\\in) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Model}_S(M,T,L)\\land\\mathrm{Model}_S(N,T,L)\\land\\dot\\in\\in L.\\mathrm{Rel}_2\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(N)\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\;\\bigl(\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in I^M_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)\\leftrightarrow\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in I^N_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)\\bigr)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(N)\\;\\bigl(\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in I^N_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)\\to y\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}end\\text{-}extension} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModelEndExtension}_S(M,N,T,L,\\dot\\in) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Model}_S(M,T,L)\\land\\mathrm{Model}_S(N,T,L)\\land\\dot\\in\\in L.\\mathrm{Rel}_2\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(N)\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\;\\bigl(\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in I^M_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)\\leftrightarrow\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in I^N_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)\\bigr)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(N)\\;\\bigl(\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in I^N_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)\\to y\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModelEndExtension}_S(M,N,T,L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcModelEndExtension}_S(M,N,T,L,\\dot\\in).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ZfcModelEndExtension}_S(M,N,T,L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcModelEndExtension}_S(M,N,T,L,\\dot\\in).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li>The agreement clause compares the explicit interpretations of the selected binary membership symbol; the final clause says that no new element of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> is inserted below an old set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"923884eb8fe4e61d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location"